// spec: 5, 7
// Bad marker names (with did-you-mean for crow's-foot ends), out-of-range stroke widths, box-only attributes on lines.
diagram "marker errors" size (300,100)
line l (20,40) -> h 200 start=arow end=circle stroke-width=0 radius=-1 fill=#fff
line m (20,80) -> h 200 start=zero_many end=onemany
